# CherryTree Mac local model catalog (GLib KeyFile format).
#
# Only official publisher repositories on Hugging Face are listed. The app
# downloads exactly the file named here, resumes interrupted downloads and
# verifies the SHA256 before the model can be used.
#
# sha256 / size_bytes are pinned with scripts/update_model_manifest.py (run it
# on a machine that can reach huggingface.co and commit the result). While a
# hash is not pinned here, the app fetches the publisher's LFS hash from the
# Hugging Face API at download time and verifies against that; the
# Preferences dialog shows which of the two applies.
#
# tier: small | medium | large      min_memory_gb: unified memory needed to run comfortably
# url: optional explicit download URL (e.g. a mirror); by default the Hugging Face "resolve" URL of repo/file
# kind: generation (default) | embedding     embedding models: pooling (mean|last|cls), query_prefix, embedding_dim
# split GGUF (file is part 1 of N): files_extra / size_bytes_extra / sha256_extra are ';' separated lists of the other parts

